{"code":"021045","name":"대호특수강우","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"철강","sector_desc":"철강재 생산·가공. 중국 공급, 원료(철광석·석탄) 가격, 건설·조선 수요에 연동되는 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1988년 냉간압조용 강선(CHQ Wire) 제조·판매 목적으로 설립되었으며, 1996년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 2012년 동방금속공업 인수합병으로 마봉강(CD-BAR) 사업부를 편입하였고, 2024년 이오이스 인수를 통해 AI 서비스 사업으로 영역을 확장하였음. 주요 사업으로 CHQ WIRE 및 CD-BAR 생산·판매를 영위하며, 자동차부품, 산업기계부품, 전자부품 등 철강부품류의 소재를 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":1480.0,"open":1450.0,"high":1569.0,"low":1450.0,"volume":2216,"amount":3279680.0,"ret_1d":-5.9123,"gap":-7.8195,"range_pct":8.0405,"ret_5":-16.9006,"ret_20":-25.4408,"ret_60":-36.7521,"ret_120":-47.1429,"ret_250":-52.1809,"ma20":1857.05,"ma60":2247.1833,"ma120":2343.55,"ma200":2505.63,"close_vs_ma200":-40.933,"close_vs_ma60":-34.1398,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-85.3133,"r2_60":0.7351,"slope_120":-46.36,"r2_120":0.4072,"slope_250":-31.9754,"r2_250":0.6352,"high52":4100.0,"low52":1450.0,"pos_52w":1.1321,"dd_52w":-63.9024,"mdd_1y":-61.2058,"atr14_pct":5.0917,"vol_ann_60":55.4795,"vol_avg20":1638.85,"vol_ratio20":1.3522,"vr5":0.9575,"vr20":0.3859,"amount_avg5":3378558.8,"amount_avg20":2998343.4,"amount_avg60":4285470.3,"obv_chg20":-74.1343,"turnover_20":3.863,"pv_eff_20":-6.5858,"rsi14":13.452,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":-1.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0001,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0001,"frgn_net_120":1.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0001,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0001,"foreign_ratio":2.5,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.01,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":14.0,"op_margin_q":1.9337,"op_qoq":null,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":-12.5,"rev_yoy":-0.1379,"op_trend_4q":73.6842,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-8.4,"debt_ratio":375.38,"per":null,"pbr":0.77,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":2.5,"target